OL,3,GNEWSANew aerial shots show size of
OL,4,Adevastating wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew aerial images have been released
OL,7,Fwhich show the devastating impact of a
OL,8,Fwildfire.
OL,10,FIt is three months since a blaze
OL,11,Fravaged Dunwich Heath in Suffolk, which
OL,12,Fthe National Trust has warned faces "a
OL,13,Flong recovery".
OL,15,FMore than 104 hectares (257 acres) of
OL,16,Fheathland were destroyed, and recent
OL,17,Fmonitoring has shown "significant
OL,18,Fimpacts" on the health of the soil.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
