OL,3,GNEWSANew aerial shots show size of
OL,4,Adevastating wildfire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The destruction has been so complete
OL,7,Fthat [although] we will see some early
OL,8,Fregrowth, a full recovery is likely to
OL,9,Ftake decades," said the trust's Russell
OL,10,FClement.
